@host = https://localhost:7001

### Login as demo client (retain the Set-Cookie value in your HTTP client)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@getsetgo.local",
  "password": "Client@123"
}

### Get anti-forgery token (retain its Set-Cookie value too)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/security/antiforgery

### Read risk profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/risk-profile

### Save risk profile (paste requestToken returned above)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/risk-profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: PASTE_REQUEST_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "capital": 100000,
  "tradingStyle": "Intraday",
  "riskPerTradePercent": 1,
  "maxTotalRiskPercent": 3,
  "minimumRewardRiskRatio": 2
}

### GET matching signals
GET {{host}}/api/v1/signals

### Get 60 daily demo OHLC candles
GET {{host}}/api/v1/market-data/RELIANCE?timeframe=1D&take=60

### SET signal 1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/signals/1/set
X-CSRF-TOKEN: PASTE_REQUEST_TOKEN_HERE

### Tracker
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders

### GO order 1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/go
X-CSRF-TOKEN: PASTE_REQUEST_TOKEN_HERE

### Cancel order 1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/cancel
X-CSRF-TOKEN: PASTE_REQUEST_TOKEN_HERE
